* the "allow an s" excpetion to anagrams.  i'm not even sure how practical
  this is. but i've been eliminating plurals from the dictionary with the
  expectation that this will work. "easy enough" to grep all s-ending words
  from dict-filter inputs and resubmit them for review i suppose. (will be
  a little more involved than that - removing duplications from input sets).

